1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:04,921
Hybrid, plug-in hybrid, or fully electric. What is actually the difference?

2
00:00:05,271 --> 00:00:10,813
A regular hybrid has an engine, an electric motor, and a small battery. You never plug it in.

3
00:00:11,163 --> 00:00:17,076
The engine and braking recharge the battery, and the motor helps out, especially in slow traffic.

4
00:00:17,426 --> 00:00:23,816
A plug-in hybrid has a bigger battery you charge at home, enough for many short trips on electricity alone.

5
00:00:24,166 --> 00:00:28,862
When the battery runs low, the engine takes over, so long trips are no problem.

6
00:00:29,212 --> 00:00:34,997
A fully electric car has no engine at all. A big battery, a motor, and a charging port.

7
00:00:35,347 --> 00:00:42,880
Can charge at home and drive mostly short trips? Electric or plug-in. No charging? A regular hybrid is easy.

8
00:00:43,230 --> 00:00:48,734
Hybrid charges itself. Plug-in charges from the wall too. Electric is all battery.
